<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Horse Life Auto Fishing</Major>
    <Description>Simple and straight forward go to fishing spot at the docks near the big stone pillars and hold out your fishing rod ( best with faster cooldown ) and start the macro.

NOTE: must be fully zoomed out and resolution set at 1920x1080</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
